rovider"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"Theme Orange","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"icon"}]},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}}}